Subject: attention-gateway P2 — world-grounding: acted overlay, already-acted drop, reversal-awareness, act-first disarm

GERMLINE CARRY NOTE: applies ON TOP of p1-action-lane-canonical-dedup.patch
(sequential: apply p1, then this). Same carry contract: authored from
scratch copies, applied on-branch with `git apply`, PR diff is the
proposal, Captain merge = apply + live-checkout relock.

What it wires (spec §8 P2):
- gather: ALREADY-ACTED section (ledger acted rows × undo journal) appended
  to signals — the proposer SEES executed + Captain-reversed state.
- propose core: acted_refs/reversed_refs params; standing acted artifacts
  drop with the distinct "already-acted" reason BEFORE generic overlap;
  reversed refs are subtracted from the covered set (a Captain-undone act
  stops suppressing its situation).
- act-first: overlay build failure = world state UNKNOWN → acting disarmed
  for the run, cards still propose ("probe-outage → unknown; card still
  proposes, never acts").

Spec: docs/plans/cabinet-attention-gateway-spec-2026-07-08.md §8 P2.

